invariant: INV-41
file: src/rsa_mont_division.h
catches: rsa_equiv_test_blocks
reason: times_r_mod runs the step in blocks for every even word count,
  not only a multiple of 4, so a count of 34 or 38 reads a last block of
  four words past the remainder's and the modulus's words, and writes
  words that are no remainder. bin/rsa_equiv_test_blocks compares rsa_vp1
  with the 32-bit arm at every word count from 32 to 64.

